      "current_title": "Monumental (if correct) advance in number theory posted to ArXiv by Yitang Zhang",
      "excerpt": "Yitang Zhang, the mathematician behind the 2013 breakthrough on bounded gaps in primes, posted to the arxiv today a result which (if correct) comes close to proving the nonexistence of Landau--Siegel zeros: https://arxiv.org/abs/2211.02515 . To give a sense of the scale of this claim: If correct, Zhang's work is the most significant progress towards the Generalized Riemann Hypothesis in a century. Moreover, I think this result would not only be a more significant advance than",
      "rank": 8,
      "guide_zh": "张益唐发布涉及朗道—西格尔零点的新结果，其正确性仍待验证。"
